{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_8fcd12858bf7021174cefa134132993019251ce2483f79f13674bac18487f97c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: a refactor handoff doc records an 800-line file limit for agent business files, a provider descriptor/strategy seam so GUI code has no per-provider identity branches, and completion gated on `pnpm check:full` passing with locked baselines."}],"claim_ids":["clm_8fcd12858bf7021174cefa134132993019251ce2483f79f13674bac18487f97c"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:20:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_f878f43e4cac413bb08350b94a18dace","id":"pg_6f9a2821214d5cd6aff73ee96fe0ada9","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/tutti-os-tutti-agent-gui-controller-refactor-handoff-md-8821cf4788f6-3ee96fe0ada9.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_fe6b937d3dc75c9db1f4021f8ab8c1ff"],"title":"tutti-os/tutti/AGENT_GUI_CONTROLLER_REFACTOR_HANDOFF.md @ 8821cf4788f6","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:20:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f878f43e4cac413bb08350b94a18dace"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1f061d957120e1a8474a2bd8e1e1b52a519f732afad71bc7caa338910fa98a51"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Tutti includes an app center shared across the workspace with apps such as image generation (AI Canvas), prototype/UI-UX design, docs, and AI PPT, usable by both humans and agents, with app outputs remaining referenceable in the workspace."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2db40593235f5a7dd7d81467d490644352a2fd9bade4a45e57f0afb460d61c55"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"In open-source Tutti, agents run locally and working state stays local; in Tutti · VM, agents still run locally on the owner's machine inside a managed local VM while working state lives in a cloud Room."},{"claim_ids":["clm_34b660108d585b2c6f344ae01d6a5458d7bd66db70a7464d939eb4fa8ae9c97b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Tutti is described as a real-time shared workspace where multiple agents share context, files, running tasks, and apps, positioned as a layer around existing coding agents rather than a replacement for them."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3d90a7e15eaf45b8fade2e805002dc60438a83c32b5b28b1be8ca47a8dc346a8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A goals-to-tasks feature lets users describe a goal, after which Tutti breaks it into sub-tasks that the user reviews and assigns to suitable agents."},{"claim_ids":["clm_457615a89e0549a9295ad06d4a9be53f7a52aa4dc3db29a6a1684ee8f4fb6205"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agents from different providers share visibility into each other's work so they can avoid or resolve conflicts and decide whether work runs in parallel or in sequence."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7422bb9f3e0d8d6283a0345d9b4dfb4250c39ecd8581759b7a063bc18242cdf5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"In Tutti · VM, sharing is scoped to the Room: only content created inside the same room is shared with invitees, and everything else remains private; creating a Room requires an invite code while joining does not."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7e74dc362c4c07b22444cbcf9e1f21ae6e14bcf4c026a04fac55f1bee2b6929d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product is fully GUI-based with no command line, and offers a Control Center view surfacing agent conversations, pending approvals, and running tasks in one place."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ad8cc2e4923bbea755d8f62ad51badc2d31d2994a62d7bad16f51dbdc00840b7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Tutti runs agents and apps on users' existing agent subscriptions rather than reselling model access; currently supported are Claude Code, Codex, and Hermes, with OpenClaw noted as in development, and a built-in free Tutti Agent during Early Access."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e0761c52348509524aa45a8e76efefa19c116797856c295bbd13128cf82b644e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"In the agent chat box, users can @ past conversations, files, app invocations, and tasks — including those of other agents and, in VM, teammates — and use \"+\" to reference local files or app outputs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e0e42b10ce78f690bd0abe55cd20c3a9a189a936236fada96c83b8494d5fbfe6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project ships two versions: an open-source Tutti for one person with multiple agents, and Tutti · VM (Early Access) adding group chat, multi-user collaboration, and work with others' agents."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1f061d957120e1a8474a2bd8e1e1b52a519f732afad71bc7caa338910fa98a51","clm_2db40593235f5a7dd7d81467d490644352a2fd9bade4a45e57f0afb460d61c55","clm_34b660108d585b2c6f344ae01d6a5458d7bd66db70a7464d939eb4fa8ae9c97b","clm_3d90a7e15eaf45b8fade2e805002dc60438a83c32b5b28b1be8ca47a8dc346a8","clm_457615a89e0549a9295ad06d4a9be53f7a52aa4dc3db29a6a1684ee8f4fb6205","clm_7422bb9f3e0d8d6283a0345d9b4dfb4250c39ecd8581759b7a063bc18242cdf5","clm_7e74dc362c4c07b22444cbcf9e1f21ae6e14bcf4c026a04fac55f1bee2b6929d","clm_ad8cc2e4923bbea755d8f62ad51badc2d31d2994a62d7bad16f51dbdc00840b7","clm_e0761c52348509524aa45a8e76efefa19c116797856c295bbd13128cf82b644e","clm_e0e42b10ce78f690bd0abe55cd20c3a9a189a936236fada96c83b8494d5fbfe6"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:20:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_f878f43e4cac413bb08350b94a18dace","id":"pg_89b385d61d555f84b241f4cbfb95b4e0","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/tutti-os-tutti-readme-md-8821cf4788f6-f4cbfb95b4e0.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_cee4c9f095265844987d82e9b396faa4"],"title":"tutti-os/tutti/README.md @ 8821cf4788f6","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:57:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_46a38f3f87354db3be09a4dfdb031f94"}
